---
// ValueProp.astro
---

<section id="soluciones" class="py-20 bg-brand-bg scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent">Nuestra Propuesta de Valor</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark mt-3 mb-6">
        Diseñamos el sistema nervioso de tu información corporativa.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        No implementamos plantillas genéricas. Construimos infraestructuras de datos y modelos financieros automatizados diseñados a la medida de tu modelo de negocio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Differentiators Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Differentiator 1 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-border-dark shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-brand-accent group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent-light text-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <!-- Database Icon -->
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Integración de Datos E2E</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Conectamos tus fuentes de datos actuales (ERP, CRM, pasarelas de pago, bancos) en una única base de datos centralizada usando arquitecturas modernas en la nube.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-accent mt-auto flex items-center">
          Tecnología escalable
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Differentiator 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-border-dark shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-brand-accent group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent-light text-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <!-- Chart Icon -->
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Criterio Financiero Experto</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-4">
          No somos solo desarrolladores. Entendemos de rentabilidad, márgenes de contribución, proyecciones de caja y control de gestión de nivel corporativo.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-accent mt-auto flex items-center">
          Visión estratégica
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Differentiator 3 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col p-8 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-border-dark shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-brand-accent group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent-light text-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <!-- Cog/Automation Icon -->
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-3">Automatización Operativa</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Eliminamos el trabajo manual. Configuramos automatizaciones robustas para conciliar cuentas, alertas en tiempo real y flujos que liberan tiempo clave.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-accent mt-auto flex items-center">
          Eficiencia escalable
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
